- version 0.23.1+git20261113141540.5c1abd2-0
- Reworked from a network-at-build-time source build (which OBS cannot
  run) into the repo's standard pattern: the payload is built by the
  package's CI-side build.sh (docker fedora, upstream commit pinned in
  the spec) and OBS repacks the tarball instead of compiling. Same git
  snapshot tracking as the other packaged builds; update.sh now only
  detects upstream movement and rebuilds the payload in CI.

